    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "COP31 \u2022 9\u201320 Kas\u0131m 2026 \u2022 Antalya\n\nDenizleri, caretta
    carettalar\u0131n ya\u015Fam alanlar\u0131n\u0131 ve g\u0131da g\xFCvenli\u011Fini
    korumak; at\u0131\u011F\u0131 kayna\u011F\u0131nda azaltmakla ba\u015Flar. Bu
    oyunda COP31 haz\u0131rl\u0131klar\u0131nda g\xF6revli bir denet\xE7isin.\n\n\u201C\u0130klim
    krizi yaln\u0131zca \xE7evresel de\u011Fil, ayn\u0131 zamanda ahlaki bir sorumluluk
    alan\u0131d\u0131r.\u201D\nEmine Erdo\u011Fan \u2022 cop31.tr\n\nEkip: 3D sanat
    / \xD6zg\xFCr: etkile\u015Fim / Faruk: veri ve kurallar / Hasan: ak\u0131\u015F
    ve entegrasyon\nG\xF6rseller: yapay zek\xE2 ile \xFCretilmi\u015F ill\xFCstrasyonlar.
    Logo: COP31 resm\xEE kurumsal kimli\u011Fi.\nMen\xFC \xF6\u011Feleri: Feathered
    Fortune proje ar\u015Fivi. Yaz\u0131 tipi: Kurale / SIL OFL.\nOyundaki haberler
    ve \xFCr\xFCn partileri kurmacad\u0131r."
